cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GPU-Center World Model"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, intervention-faithful world model for GPU datacenter
  operations. The first proof-of-concept is a counterfactual admission-control
  and topology-aware rack-placement advisor that pairs an exact symbolic
  feasibility kernel with a learned residual world model under calibrated
  uncertainty. Safety is enforced as a gate, not a weighted metric.
